  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;The proposed two&amp;nbsp;storey side extension together with the\r\nhip to gable roof extension, by reason of their excessive combined bulk and the\r\nfirst floor side element’s failure to incorporate a sympathetic roof form,\r\nresults in an unduly bulky and dominant addition to the host dwelling and\r\nstreet scene. The&amp;nbsp;development&amp;nbsp;is therefore&amp;nbsp;contrary to the high\r\nquality design aspirations of the National Planning Policy Framework (2024),\r\nPolicies D3.D(1) and D3.D(11) of The London Plan (2021), Core Policy CS1.B of\r\nthe Harrow Core Strategy (2012), Policy DM1 A., DM1 B. (a), (b) and (c) of the\r\nHarrow Development Management Policies Local Plan (2013) and the adopted\r\nSupplementary Planning Document: Residential Design Guide (2010) and the Draft\r\nHarrow Local Plan 2021-2044: GR1&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
